# src/apps/android/app/src/test/java

## Purpose
Provides the JVM package root for local Android application unit tests.

## Contents
Contains namespace directories leading to LumiNet host-side unit and behavior tests.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Used by Gradle and the JVM compiler for the local test source set, with dependencies on application contracts and test doubles.

## Invariants
Only local test sources belong here; package layout must match declarations and tests must not rely on production packaging side effects.